<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Jan-Sept copper output up, alumina down.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Jan-Sept copper output up, alumina down.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's blister copper production rose by 10.5 percent to 20,424 tonnes in the first nine months of this year from 18,484 tonnes in the same 1995 period, the State Institute of Statistics said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said alumina output fell by 16.34 percent to 121,679 tonnes in January-September from 145,448 tonnes a year ago.</p>
</text>
